      "isComplex": false,
      "level": {
        "value": 13
      },
      "disable": "<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:thievery|dc:40] (Master)</span></p>\n<p>Or @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic} (8th level; counteract DC 35) to counteract the trap before it triggers or to counteract the effect after the trap is triggered&nbsp;</p>",
      "description": "<p>The labyrinthine script draws you into an extradimensional nightmare maze of eldritch origin and traps you there.</p>",
      "reset": "",
      "routine": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> - Touching the door or reading the runes attempts to trap intruders in an extradimensional nightmare maze.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> - All valid creatures within 30 feet are trapped in a @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.Oj1PJBMQD9vuwCv7]{Maze} spell (DC 36), but once any one trapped creature escapes the maze, all currently entrapped victims escape at once, reappearing on the north side of the now-once-again closed Aklo doors. Each round they are trapped each victim is subject to a 4th level @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.tlcrVRqW1MSKJ5IC]{Phantasmal Killer} spell (DC 36)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
    },
